    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Mercenary Oathband",
    "summary": "For units with **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** from your army, [Prioritised Efficiency](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.prioritised-efficiency) loses two options: [Hostile Acquisition](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.prioritised-efficiency) and [Fortify Takeover](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.prioritised-efficiency). Grant them [Hostile Acquisition](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.prioritised-efficiency) when battle begins. At your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase)’s end, you can spend 3 YP from your pool. The payment replaces [Hostile Acquisition](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.prioritised-efficiency) with [Fortify Takeover](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.prioritised-efficiency) on those units.",
